  <trk>
    <name>WALK 13. Catrine to Blacksidend</name>
    <desc>Starting at Catrine bowling club car park and following the River Ayr walk to Sorn. Continue walk through the woods round the village, then up the country road toward Blacksidend, climbing the hill directly behind the U shape farm building and sheep pens, returning the same route</desc>
